            "review_text": "Jade Florence Photography\nFootscray, Australia33 contributions\n0\nFriendly and affordable\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nThis place was packed when we went which is the first sign of great food in Vietnam! The food was excellent, and all the cooks are lovely. It's was also unbelievably cheap! We had two huge bowls of noodle soup for AU$3.50. If you are vegan or even veggie or just into good food, you should go here!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 8, 2018",
